WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.800
You've been working intently on a critical project for a while now.

00:05.800 --> 00:10.300
It's organized, thoughtful, and strategically aligned.

00:10.300 --> 00:14.200
People are counting on the current version.

00:14.200 --> 00:17.600
However, you just got news.

00:17.600 --> 00:19.900
The plans have changed.

00:19.900 --> 00:27.400
What you built for the last few months is no longer the priority.

00:27.400 --> 00:33.600
Before you respond, what do you notice? In your body, in your thoughts,

00:33.600 --> 00:37.400
your feelings, and your urge to act?

00:48.500 --> 00:51.900
Whatever you're noticing isn't wrong.

00:51.900 --> 00:55.800
It's your system's opening move under change.

00:55.800 --> 01:00.000
The conditioning is choosing your next move on purpose,

01:00.000 --> 01:04.200
instead of letting your immediate instinct choose for you.

01:05.100 --> 01:09.200
A. Push back and defend the original plan.

01:09.250 --> 01:14.750
B. Quietly absorb it and adjust on your own.

01:14.850 --> 01:19.750
C. Go straight to the people affected and rebuild together.

01:19.850 --> 01:24.000
D. Pause and ask questions before reacting.

01:29.200 --> 01:35.000
Same pressure one more time, but try the option you didn't pick.

01:44.050 --> 01:47.800
You just practiced the option that isn't automatic yet.

01:48.300 --> 01:52.900
That's what conditioning feels like before the moment demands it.
